commit 6e59db51
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 12:23:11 -0600
subject: fix(smart-router): declare smartRouterMeta — P0 crash in chat.js

Review (research/9router/20-review-otherbot-work-vs-research.md) caught:
smartRouterMeta was used at 5 call sites (123/138/159/169/347) but never
declared — every chat request would throw ReferenceError and 500. eslint
missed it (no-undef only fires on parsed scope; the rename happened across
threaded files).

Fix: renamed the declared local smartRouterScores -> smartRouterMeta to match
the threaded param name everywhere.

Verified: node --check clean; 8/8 smart-router tests + 33 related tests pass;
live chat request 200 (was 500); smart-router path no longer crashes (its
remaining failure is missing blackbox credentials in test env).


